ing my running challenge toward 50 days.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Day 30 — The Final Run</title><link href="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-30/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Day 30 — The Final Run"/><published>2026-10-12T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-12T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/running-day-30</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-30/"><![CDATA[<p>The final day of my 30-day running challenge: 5.02 km recorded.</p> <p><img src="/assets/img/challenges/running/day-30.jpeg" alt="Day 30 — Running activity summary"/></p> <h2 id="my-run">My Run</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Date:</strong> October 12, 2026</li> <li><strong>Distance:</strong> 5.02 km</li> <li><strong>Moving time:</strong> 37:21</li> <li><strong>Average pace:</strong> 7:26 min/km</li> <li><strong>Daily goal:</strong> 5 km</li> <li><strong>Goal:</strong> Met</li> </ul> <hr/> <p><a href="/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-29/">← Day 29</a> · <a href="/challenges/30-days-of-running/">All 30 days</a></p> <p>The challenge continues: <a href="/challenges/50-days-of-running/day-31/">Day 31 →</a> · <a href="/challenges/50-days-of-running/">50 Days of Running</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="challenges"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[5.02 km on day 30 of my 30-day running challenge.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Day 29 — 5.04 km</title><link href="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-29/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Day 29 — 5.04 km"/><published>2026-10-11T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-11T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/running-day-29</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-29/"><![CDATA[<p>Day 29 of my 30-day r