ges"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[5.53 km on day 25 of my 30-day running challenge.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Day 24 — The App Took a Break</title><link href="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-24/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Day 24 — The App Took a Break"/><published>2026-10-06T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-06T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/running-day-24</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-24/"><![CDATA[<p>I ran 8.5 km, but the app decided 5 km of it should stay between me and the road. 😄 Only 3.5 km made it into the recording!</p> <p><img src="/assets/img/challenges/running/day-24.jpeg" alt="Day 24 — Running activity summary"/></p> <h2 id="my-run">My Run</h2> <ul> <li><strong>Date:</strong> October 6, 2026</li> <li><strong>Actual distance:</strong> 8.50 km</li> <li><strong>App-recorded distance:</strong> 3.50 km</li> <li><strong>Recorded moving time:</strong> 29:24</li> <li><strong>Recorded average pace:</strong> 8:23 min/km</li> <li><strong>Daily goal:</strong> 5 km</li> <li><strong>Goal:</strong> Met</li> </ul> <p>The screenshot, moving time, and pace cover only the portion the app recorded.</p> <hr/> <p><a href="/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-23/">← Day 23</a> · <a href="/challenges/30-days-of-running/">All 30 days</a> · <a href="/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-25/">Day 25 →</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="challenges"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[An 8.5 km run, with only 3.5 km captured by the app.]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">Day 23 — 5.00 km</title><link href="https://ahmedmoragab.github.io/challenges/30-days-of-running/day-23/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Day 23 — 5.00 km"/><published>2026-10-05T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-05T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ahmedmoragab.g